  "body": "This is your chance to secure an exceptional 939 m² vacant lot in Half Moon Bay, Auckland, offering stunning sea views and a prime location. With a motivated vendor ready to sell, this rare opportunity is perfect for building your luxury dream home in a highly sought-after area subject to council approval.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Expansive 939 m² land-ideal for a spacious, custom-built luxury residence\r\n* Uninterrupted sea views for a serene, scenic lifestyle\r\n* Located in an upscale neighborhood, surrounded by high-end homes\r\n* Essential services, including stormwater and wastewater connections, nearby for ease of development\r\n* Close to Half Moon Bay Marina, shopping, top schools, and transport links\r\n\r\n\r\nThis motivated sale offers a unique chance to own premium land with nearby infrastructure, making it an easy build site for your future dream home. \r\n\r\nAct fast- contact us today to make an offer!",
